msgstr "`HashEmbedder` 这个回退方案存在的唯一理由，是让流水线在没有网关时也能跑（开发/CI）；它的检索质量很弱。"

#: ../developer/rag-chat.md:179
msgid ""
"No answer caching, no reranking, and history is truncated to the last few"
